# Files Docker must never send into the build (build context: backend/WeatherUserActions).

# Secrets - otherwise `dotnet publish` copies secrets.json into the image
**/secrets.json

# Build output - rebuilt inside the container
**/bin/
**/obj/

# Local logs and IDE files
**/logs/
**/*.log
**/.vs/
**/*.user

# Not needed to build the app
WeatherUserActions.Tests/
docs/
README.md
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
